OL,3,GNEWSABeatles-signed Cavern member card
OL,4,Aon sale for #25k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare Cavern Club membership card
OL,7,Fsigned 21 times by The Beatles before
OL,8,Fthey were famous has been put up for
OL,9,Fsale for nearly #25,000.
OL,11,FThe 1961 Liverpool club booklet was
OL,12,Fsigned by John Lennon, Paul McCartney,
OL,13,FGeorge Harrison and original drummer
OL,14,FPete Best.
OL,16,FThe signatures date from when the band
OL,17,Fwere aged between 18 and 20, and before
OL,18,FBest was dropped and replaced by Ringo
OL,19,FStarr.
